<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities condemned the deadly attack on a Greek Orthodox church in Jordan and arrested suspects, while Iraqi leaders publicly blamed external agents for the incident. The government also announced that armed factions and weapons are being placed under state control and warned that such groups could be drawn into a potential US-Iran conflict. Iraqi forces, cooperating with the UAE, seized 200,000 Captagon pills in a joint operation, and the Iraqi prime minister said the country will soon be free of armed factions. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQSkwzdmVjM1VleTdFdUZub3RRWnFNc1pxbmhQeHpFd2kyT0lrX3hULURFQjdwOEY1SnB5X2pSUFFhQk5mX01UTTREUlRkT3FabURPV3g2NmRCdXgtNTFVWnRzZ3BNcGZiQ1BJSGRoVFkwM2I5aGZobHZULVlrVjdLdDRzMHVaNGx4eG5QbmpWS3NHOVJvd0FNazl2bjlzMVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNbC1iaW5QNFdHaEJZT3NuTTFObjR2RVVoNHJJR2IxRjl4U3lvREs1RWoxN085OUFSc04taVlPVWRDdjZEQkl3ci1BTG9jTWFmOVFBXzh3dVFmUzR5UFFYbzZyVjFMd2pOYmpmaG9BQUwyd2RQbFJwd2VvTHZKTEdhaTk0bldWRE5HVS1WNG5scjNJZnpnWldKd2xDVlZkWU9zQ2lfN3RoVDRfdXFiSGFyWTBaaThwU3E4?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxObUVPNFNwVTlXRks3dE5paUU5cUlVU0NlS2VHUm9iVWtMd2ZPaGJsa29YY1JmWWFFSmcxLXEtMkZyX01MY1FpQzNpSTJkajA0Y0gxWG9XeklWcGlmcFpFcWk3WnNIaUVRdVkweERmYldmN3VMd0pQVmtMZFZndnZNUjlXckJNYkRiYTlv?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQWnR3dGFQWi1CZDl2Z2EyWjZhMjVmN3ZTMlp4ZlRtSURza3gwZXZrSEtKWGpCYkdUazljVU9FU2JjbGU4LVl4dXprSnI2bGE4TlhDS05FQ2c5eFp3SjZCbUR6UGJ4UjhKcjh2cGxyUmVSQnZRM3FhNEFrU245cUhGRktxV3lHd3lJQmt1Z2l3?oc=5&quot;&